Ask me what our income is for the month.
Ask me what our rent is.
Ask me what our utilities are.
Ask me what our insurance is.
Ask me what our phone bill is.
Add rent to the bills, add utilities to the bills, add insurance to the bills and add phone to the bills.
Say how much is left when you take the bills away from the income.
If the money that is left is less than $500, say that we need to be careful this month.
Ask me how much we want to save each month.
Say how many months it will take us to save $5,000 for our emergency fund.
